Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your lounge experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} airport.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We always want our customers to have a relaxing and enjoyable experience in our lounges, so I'm sorry to hear you were dissatisfied with the food that was served.<br />
<br />
We place a high priority on both the quality and selection of the food we serve on board, and our Food and Beverage team work hard to choose options that everyone can enjoy.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
We’re constantly reviewing our menus, so I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
